// zode settings
//
// This file starts empty on purpose: every key written here OVERRIDES the
// shipped defaults in `assets/settings/default.json`. Seeding values would
// silently pin new installs to whatever was current the day the seed was
// written, which is how the bundled theme and font size stopped taking effect.
//
// zode is a fork of Zed, so Zed's configuration documentation applies:
// https://zed.dev/docs/configuring-zed
//
// To read every default without touching this file, run
// `zed: open default settings` from the command palette (cmd-shift-p).
// The action namespace is still `zed:` — it is inherited from upstream.
{}
